  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ITWAK: Strengthening GBV Prevention and Response in E.and C.Equatoria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project enhances GBV prevention and response in Kapoeta South and Torit (EES) and Juba (CES) counties. It provides survivor-centered support, strengthens community-based protection mechanisms, and raises awareness to challenge harmful norms. The project also builds the capacity of local actors to improve access to essential services, ensuring safer communities for women and girls.</narrative>
  </description>
